# The game reads these CSVs byte-for-byte: CRLF between records, but bare LF
# inside quoted multi-line cells. Git's EOL conversion is not CSV-aware and would
# rewrite the in-cell LFs too, corrupting multi-line dialogue. So: no conversion.
# "diff" keeps them showing as readable text diffs on GitHub despite -text.
*.csv  -text diff

# Fonts
*.ttf  binary

# Docs and scripts
*.md   text eol=lf
*.ps1  text eol=crlf
*.csx  text eol=crlf
*.txt  text
